Decision: no push minute falls in Session 1's first 5 minutes
(09:00–09:04), whose highs and lows almost every code sets at once;
Session 2 has no such skip. See apinrdw/kumora#602.

Decision: near depth, empty ticks and the spread are gone from readings;
lots stay because `limitOf` reads an empty side from them. See
apinrdw/kumora#601.

Decision: the root declares the optional peers alchemy and
@alchemy.run/cloudflare load at runtime (`alchemy dev` fails without
@effect/platform-bun), since pnpm never auto-installs optional peers.
@alchemy.run/infisical is for `alchemy profile`, which reads the manifests
above the app folder. See apinrdw/kumora#16 and #122.
